    "intro_narrative": "The rain hasn't stopped for three days in the neon-lit city of Veridian. You stand inside the dimly lit office of Detective Vance, a private investigator who vanished without a trace last week while looking into the 'Shadow Syndicate'. The room is a mess of scattered files, bizarre electronic devices, and blinking terminals. Vance was paranoid, and rightfully so—he encrypted his ultimate findings behind a complex web of interconnected gadgets and hidden compartments. Your objective is clear: you must piece together the fragmented clues, route the correct data through his custom-built decryption array, and activate the Final Masterframe to uncover the identity of the syndicate's leader before they find you.",
    "narrative_style": "detective"
  },
